Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.43,0:20:05.90,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,门 已 经 ...
Dialogue: 1,0:20:02.43,0:20:05.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}门 已 经 ...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.13,0:20:12.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打开来了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.77,0:20:15.11,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.71,0:20:19.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜拜 {\i1}童{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.20,0:20:23.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有空就来玩哦 {\i1}童{\i0}！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.05,0:20:41.22,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了！平安归来！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.66,0:20:44.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 欢迎回来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.27,0:20:46.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特训 感觉怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.39,0:20:51.31,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然挺要命 还蛮有意思的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.73,0:20:53.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈哈 那就好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.16,0:20:57.81,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙... 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.59,0:20:59.56,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.75,0:21:01.80,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系的 公主
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.31,0:21:05.37,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 很好玩 所以没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.58,0:21:08.05,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,下次小空也一起去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.18,0:21:11.52,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.37,0:21:15.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 烟花大会要开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.95,0:21:18.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 把那些拿出来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.07,0:21:20.30,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.07,0:21:22.48,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,“那些”？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.61,0:21:26.12,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,诶 是公主做的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.58,0:21:31.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 说着“为了大家" 小空出了不少力呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.42,0:21:33.63,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,出力了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.30,0:21:36.47,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 这个好吃！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.44,0:21:39.34,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,打耳光都不会放的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.01,0:21:41.76,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.13,0:21:43.95,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你 小空
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.92,0:21:46.49,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,诶嘿嘿...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.60,0:21:53.53,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.01,0:21:56.12,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,烟花... 最棒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.35,0:21:57.73,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.56,0:22:09.26,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是我 Cure Butterfly哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.56,0:22:09.26,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1050,980)}蝴蝶愈卫
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.81,0:22:12.83,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 一起神采飞扬地跳吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.22,0:23:48.89,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小蝶的姐姐是模特儿吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.06,0:23:50.26,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我没有说过吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.42,0:23:52.18,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是时尚界的英雄呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.41,0:23:55.19,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,小空也要上时装秀哦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.40,0:23:56.60,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,走咯！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.77,0:23:58.04,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.03,0:24:00.58,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Hirogaru Sky！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.03,0:24:00.58,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}海阔天空！光之美少女
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.58,0:24:02.71,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,蝶华的神采飞扬时装秀
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.33,0:02:08.54,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}（冲上蓝天！）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.54,0:02:14.13,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飞 超越云巅
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.34,0:02:19.68,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,飞吧！向着海阔天空的世界 Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.68,0:02:27.39,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（晴空万里 美丽蓝天 翱翔吧）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.59,0:02:32.55,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,雨后初霁天空棱镜折射出彩虹
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.79,0:02:36.76,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝天的景色预告着有好事发生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.76,0:02:38.28,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（蓝天的景色）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.28,0:02:42.55,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,想要确认一下 便伸直了双手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.16,0:02:47.16,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住了名为希望的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.22,0:02:49.12,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,秒速紧握！紧紧握住！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.25,0:02:53.71,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,战胜绝望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.09,0:02:57.65,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,我们能坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.65,0:03:01.05,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}擦干眼泪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.70,0:03:01.05,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}（你已经做好准备了吗）
